# Template only. Do not put real values in the repository or /etc.
# Install a private file at /var/lib/hermes/telegram.env, owned by hermes,
# mode 0600, or replace the optional environmentFiles entry with a SOPS file.
# A separate bot token is mandatory while OpenClaw's Telegram bot runs.
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=REPLACE_WITH_A_NEW_BOTFATHER_TOKEN
# TELEGRAM_HOME_CHANNEL=REPLACE_WITH_OWNER_NUMERIC_CHAT_ID
